content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Owner",
      "description": "Person who commissions and finances the construction project."
    },
    {
      "name": "Design Request",
      "description": "A request from the owner to the architect describing design needs and requirements."
    },
    {
      "name": "Architect",
      "description": "Professional responsible for creating and updating blueprints based on design requests and regulations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Blueprint",
      "description": "Detailed architectural plan that defines the structure and layout of the building."
    },
    {
      "name": "Permit Application",
      "description": "Formal application submitted to the city for approval to begin construction, containing the blueprint.",
      "attributes": [
        "Blueprint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Permit",
      "description": "Official approval document from the city that authorizes the start of construction."
    },
    {
      "name": "City Officer",
      "description": "Official responsible for reviewing permits and conducting inspections to ensure compliance."
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Project",
      "description": "Active building project managed by the overseer and executed by workers.",
      "attributes": [
        "Construction Worker",
        "Project Schedule",
        "Blueprint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Worker",
      "description": "Laborer who carries out construction tasks according to overseer instructions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Schedule",
      "description": "Timeline and sequence of construction activities for the project."
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspection",
      "description": "City officer’s evaluation of the construction site for compliance with safety and building standards."
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Overseer",
      "description": "Manager responsible for executing the project, coordinating workers, and maintaining safety and progress."
    },
    {
      "name": "Safety Concern Report",
      "description": "Notice raised by a worker to report potential hazards or unsafe conditions to the overseer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Instruction",
      "description": "Task or directive given by the overseer to guide worker activities on site."
    }
  ]
}
```
